  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Ever since the new update the other day, world loading has been seriously messed up for me. I can (usually) load into my home world, though even that has issues. It'll much longer than usual at the connecting phase, sometimes it'l error and say \"vrchat isnt responding\" in an in game message and then attempt to reload into the world. It usually works the second time, though its still slow. Big issue comes when loading into other worlds after. It all goes black, and its like a 15% chance that the load screen pops up and actually tries to load which then the stops responding loop happens. The rest of the time the screen just stays black and won't load at all no matter how long it sits. I've already checked drivers, reinstalled, cleared cache, tried disabling antivirus, checked my dns and updated it to googles servers, verified file integrity... in general, this has been a massive pain to deal with.",
